Here is the problematic function:

```javascript
function flattenData(data) {
  let result = [];
  for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i++) {
    if (Array.isArray(data[i])) {
      result = result.concat(flattenData(data[i]));
    } else {
      result.push(data[i]);
    }
  }
  return result;
}
```

